# Down in the Valley, a Saga: "I - Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. II - This
# Saga gains 'Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, create a 1/1 green Elf creature token.' III, IV - Elves you control get
# +1/+0 and gain vigilance until end of turn." Chapter I (turn 1) fetches the Forest; a Plains played the same turn makes no Elf (not
# gained yet). After II (turn 3) the Forest makes a 1/1 green Elf, Bot2's Island none. III (turn 5) makes the Elf 2/1 with vigilance
# until end of turn - Bot2's Llanowar Elves and Bot1's own Ornithopter get nothing - and an Elf made after it is a 1/1 (only the Elves
# there as it resolved); it is 1/1 again on turn 6. IV (turn 7) pumps both and the Saga is sacrificed: a land then makes no more Elves.

